---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Indian Keto — Get in Touch"
  description="Contact the Indian Keto team. We'd love to hear your questions, suggestions, and feedback about keto Indian food."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-6">Contact Us</h1>
      <div class="prose-keto">
        <p>We'd love to hear from you! Whether you have a question about Indian keto cooking, a recipe suggestion, or just want to say hello — we're here.</p>
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@indianketo.com">hello@indianketo.com</a>. We typically respond within 24-48 hours.</p>
        <h2>Social Media</h2>
        <p>Follow us for daily Indian keto tips, recipes, and inspiration:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Twitter/X: <a href="https://twitter.com/indianketo">@indianketo</a></li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Collaborations</h2>
        <p>Interested in partnering with Indian Keto? We're open to collaborations with brands, recipe developers, and fellow keto content creators. Email us with your proposal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
